        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722270601": {
            "id": "722270601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Are the Maushiro something very important?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7222701",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722270101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722270101": {
            "id": "722270101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "You two look so cool while you're fighting!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270102"
            ]
          },
          "722270102": {
            "id": "722270102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, you're here too, Ruu!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270105"
            ]
          },
          "722270105": {
            "id": "722270105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I'm fine, don't worry!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270106"
            ]
          },
          "722270106": {
            "id": "722270106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About those monsters...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270108"
            ]
          },
          "722270108": {
            "id": "722270108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I don't know where they came from either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270109"
            ]
          },
          "722270109": {
            "id": "722270109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They sure don't look native to this place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270110"
            ]
          },
          "722270110": {
            "id": "722270110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Mm-hmm. In the past, we didn't have any such monsters on our island. There weren't any furry people or big machines either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270111"
            ]
          },
          "722270111": {
            "id": "722270111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "In the past, we used to have this native animal we called \"Wen Kamuy.\" They were very gentle... and very delicious, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270112"
            ]
          },
          "722270112": {
            "id": "722270112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Haven't seen those around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270113"
            ]
          },
          "722270113": {
            "id": "722270113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I thought so too. I don't know when it happened, but they all seem to have vanished, and these monsters appeared in their place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270114"
            ]
          },
          "722270114": {
            "id": "722270114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Maybe they came in from outside the Sea of Fog...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270115"
            ]
          },
          "722270115": {
            "id": "722270115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There are hilichurls in the outside world too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270116"
            ]
          },
          "722270116": {
            "id": "722270116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Isn't that really dangerous?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7222702",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722270201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722270201": {
            "id": "722270201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I'm gonna grow up as quick as I can, and then I'll become an adventurer, just like you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7222703",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722270301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722270301": {
            "id": "722270301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looks like we're done here as well!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270302"
            ]
          },
          "722270302": {
            "id": "722270302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Wow, so this is what a real adventurer can do, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270303"
            ]
          },
          "722270303": {
            "id": "722270303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I mean, other people did come here before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270304"
            ]
          },
          "722270304": {
            "id": "722270304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "But none of them were as strong as you and Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270305"
            ]
          },
          "722270305": {
            "id": "722270305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Others!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270306"
            ]
          },
          "722270306": {
            "id": "722270306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Yeah, they came to look for Maushiro.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270309"
            ]
          },
          "722270309": {
            "id": "722270309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon doesn't get it, though. What are these Maushiro? We've heard that they're traditional instruments that the people here use...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270310"
            ]
          },
          "722270310": {
            "id": "722270310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Yup~ They make sounds and stuff.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270311"
            ]
          },
          "722270311": {
            "id": "722270311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "It's hard for us to see in this fog, right? That's why we use the Maushiro to tell others where we are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270312"
            ]
          },
          "722270312": {
            "id": "722270312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I mean, it sure beats yelling! That really hurts the throat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270313"
            ]
          },
          "722270313": {
            "id": "722270313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's true that you can't see anything around here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270314"
            ]
          },
          "722270314": {
            "id": "722270314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270315"
            ]
          },
          "722270315": {
            "id": "722270315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Da... Grandpa Mata said that the Maushiro can help the souls of those lost in the fog to find their way back home, so they're very important.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270316"
            ]
          },
          "722270316": {
            "id": "722270316",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So they're that important, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270317"
            ]
          },
          "722270317": {
            "id": "722270317",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No wonder you need them in the ceremony.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270318"
            ]
          },
          "722270318": {
            "id": "722270318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "That's right. I'm sure you'll both enjoy it very much!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270319"
            ]
          },
          "722270319": {
            "id": "722270319",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "You guys go first. I'd like to stay under the tree for while more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270320"
            ]
          },
          "722270320": {
            "id": "722270320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure you'll be alright? There might be monsters out there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722270321"
            ]
          },
          "722270321": {
            "id": "722270321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I'll be fine!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}